bc","cmd-c3a8a9ffb7a4408f","cmd-5fd4ba166bec440d","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets"]},"overall_summary":"All material outcomes are satisfied. The single-node restart protocol is complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot ID were captured, the reboot was acknowledged, connection loss was observed, a different boot ID appeared, and the account, sudo policy, SSH service, endpoint, and delegated behavior recovered. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently agree with the executor evidence.","limitations":["The executable portion of the sudoers entry is redacted in captured policy output, preventing character-for-character inspection; successful exact-command execution and denial tests nevertheless directly demonstrate the intended effective behavior.","The privilege boundary was behaviorally sampled with two unrelated administrative commands rather than every conceivable command, though the complete effective sudo listing and group membership provide strong policy-level evidence."]}
